 "remarks": "Enjoy easy, low-maintenance living in the heart of East Norwalk at 4 Van Zant Street #B18. Offering the largest floor plan in the complex at 704 square feet, this beautifully maintained two-bedroom, one-bath condo combines space, condition and an exceptional location just minutes from the water.  The current owners have taken great care of the home and made a number of thoughtful improvements, including new windows throughout, updated appliances and other recent renovations. The result is a bright, comfortable and truly move-in-ready space with a surprisingly generous layout. Two well-sized bedrooms provide flexibility for guests, a home office or everyday living, while the main living area feels open, inviting and easy to enjoy.  The pet-friendly building adds to the appeal, with heat and hot water included in the common charges and a location that puts so much of Norwalk within easy reach. Spend weekends at nearby Calf Pasture Beach or Veterans Park, walk or bike along the waterfront, grab dinner in SoNo, or take advantage of the nearby East Norwalk Metro-North station for an easy commute.  With the largest layout in the complex, a long list of updates and a prime East Norwalk location, #B18 offers an outstanding opportunity to own a turnkey home in one of Norwalk's most desirable and convenient neighborhoods.",
